  "title": "TikTok's New AI Chatbot: Tako",
  "summary": "Have you ever scrolled through TikTok, stumbled on a video, and wondered if what you’re seeing is actually true? TikTok’s new AI, Tako, is here to change that. It’s ready to answer your questions, offer personalized recommendations, and even help you learn new skills, all without ever leaving the app. Users can click the icon directly from their For You Page. The icon appears above the profile picture, which is the top-most button on the right side of the screen. This makes it easy to spot and very accessible for everyone.",
